 "structural_change": "cij successor (HBM-TILES-B 10-17) after the hcoll_inj_idx_join gate (HBM-C): one 9,926-sink root at TT insertion 396 ps, dl[7] slot select 4,208/4,180 loads, rst_q 321 loads. rg: TWO regional roots (clk_r0 lower half, clk_r1 upper half) by DATA BIT HALF (region r owns bits [256r+:256] of every 512-bit word: staging, SU word, output); per 32-bit group kept copies of the slot/source selects and of tx_v/write slots (<= ~256 loads each); one reset capture per region. Ports split by region (die contract bit-range edges, see RTL header). Same edges and faults: original bench MUT0 PASS / MUT1-4 FAIL on the rg, random lockstep vs the original PASS (skewed clk_r1 and slot mutant FAIL). 216x388.8: E idx data 1,024 b per half over ~182 um (5.6/um), header between them."
